[
  { "slug": "var-let-const", "term": "var / let / const", "zh_name": "變數宣告", "category": "syntax", "langs": ["javascript"], "difficulty": 2, "plain": "宣告變數三種：const 不能重新賦值(預設用它)、let 可以改、var 是舊寫法(有作用域陷阱、別再用)。", "example": "const PI = 3.14\nlet count = 0", "related": ["variable", "hoisting", "scope"] },
  { "slug": "arrow-function", "term": "arrow function", "zh_name": "箭頭函式", "category": "syntax", "langs": ["javascript"], "difficulty": 2, "plain": "用 => 寫的簡短函式。除了短，它「不綁自己的 this」（沿用外層），很多 callback 愛用。", "example": "const add = (a, b) => a + b", "related": ["function", "this-js", "callback"] },
  { "slug": "destructuring", "term": "destructuring", "zh_name": "解構賦值", "category": "syntax", "langs": ["javascript"], "difficulty": 2, "plain": "「一次從物件/陣列拆出值」給變數。React 拿 props、useState 都靠它。", "example": "const { name, age } = user\nconst [a, b] = arr", "related": ["spread-rest", "unpacking", "usestate"] },
  { "slug": "spread-rest", "term": "spread / rest (...)", "zh_name": "展開 / 其餘", "category": "syntax", "langs": ["javascript"], "difficulty": 2, "plain": "同一個 ... 符號：展開(把陣列/物件攤開，複製或合併)、其餘(把剩下的收成一個)。", "example": "const merged = { ...a, ...b }\nconst copy = [...arr]", "related": ["destructuring", "args-kwargs"] },
  { "slug": "template-literal", "term": "template literal", "zh_name": "模板字串", "category": "syntax", "langs": ["javascript"], "difficulty": 1, "plain": "用反引號 ` 包字串，能用 ${} 直接塞變數、能換行。等同 Python 的 f-string。", "example": "`嗨 ${name}，共 ${n} 筆`", "related": ["f-string", "string"] },
  { "slug": "strict-equality", "term": "== vs ===", "zh_name": "寬鬆 vs 嚴格相等", "category": "concept", "langs": ["javascript"], "difficulty": 2, "plain": "=== 比「值和型別都一樣」；== 會自動轉型別再比(有一堆詭異結果)。JS 幾乎永遠該用 ===。", "example": "0 == '0'   // true(雷)\n0 === '0'  // false", "related": ["truthy-falsy", "operator"] },
  { "slug": "hoisting", "term": "hoisting", "zh_name": "提升", "category": "concept", "langs": ["javascript"], "difficulty": 3, "plain": "JS「把宣告偷偷提到最前面」的行為。var 跟函式宣告會被提升，導致「還沒宣告就用」不報錯但值是 undefined。用 let/const 較不會踩雷。", "related": ["var-let-const", "scope"] },
  { "slug": "this-js", "term": "this (JavaScript)", "zh_name": "this", "category": "concept", "langs": ["javascript"], "difficulty": 3, "plain": "JS 最讓人頭痛的字：this「指誰」看你怎麼呼叫函式，會變。箭頭函式不綁自己的 this(沿用外層)是常見解法。", "related": ["arrow-function", "closure"] },
  { "slug": "event-loop", "term": "event loop", "zh_name": "事件迴圈", "category": "concept", "langs": ["javascript"], "difficulty": 3, "plain": "JS 是單執行緒，靠事件迴圈「排隊處理非同步的東西」（setTimeout、fetch 回來的）。搞懂它才懂為什麼程式碼順序不照你想的跑。", "related": ["async", "callback", "promise"] },
  { "slug": "callback-hell", "term": "callback hell", "zh_name": "回呼地獄", "category": "slang", "langs": ["javascript"], "difficulty": 2, "plain": "callback 一層包一層、縮排越來越深，變成「金字塔」超難讀。用 Promise / async-await 拉平它。", "related": ["callback", "promise", "async"] },
  { "slug": "array-methods-js", "term": "map / filter / reduce", "zh_name": "陣列方法（JS）", "category": "concept", "langs": ["javascript"], "difficulty": 2, "plain": "JS 陣列三神器：map 每個都轉換、filter 篩選、reduce 把一整排濃縮成一個值(加總)。React 渲染清單超常用 map。", "example": "arr.map(x => x * 2).filter(x => x > 3)", "related": ["map-filter", "list-methods", "key-prop"] },
  { "slug": "optional-chaining", "term": "optional chaining (?.)", "zh_name": "可選鏈", "category": "syntax", "langs": ["javascript"], "difficulty": 2, "plain": "用 ?. 安全地取深層屬性：中間是 null/undefined 就回 undefined、不會噴錯。省掉一堆 if 檢查。", "example": "user?.profile?.name", "related": ["null", "nullish-coalescing", "null-pointer"] },
  { "slug": "nullish-coalescing", "term": "nullish coalescing (??)", "zh_name": "空值合併", "category": "syntax", "langs": ["javascript"], "difficulty": 2, "plain": "用 ?? 給「只有在 null/undefined 時」才用預設值。跟 || 差在：0、'' 這種假值不會被覆蓋掉。", "example": "const n = count ?? 10", "related": ["optional-chaining", "truthy-falsy"] },
  { "slug": "es-module", "term": "import / export (ES module)", "zh_name": "模組匯入匯出", "category": "syntax", "langs": ["javascript"], "difficulty": 2, "plain": "JS 拆檔案共用程式碼：export 把東西丟出去、import 拿進來。default export 一個主角、named export 可多個。", "example": "export function f(){}\nimport { f } from './x'", "related": ["module-import", "npm"] },
  { "slug": "json-methods", "term": "JSON.parse / stringify", "zh_name": "JSON 轉換（JS）", "category": "syntax", "langs": ["javascript"], "difficulty": 1, "plain": "JSON.parse 把 JSON 字串轉成物件、JSON.stringify 把物件轉成字串。傳 API、存 localStorage 常用。", "related": ["json", "json-module", "localstorage"] },
  { "slug": "css-position", "term": "position", "zh_name": "定位", "category": "syntax", "langs": ["css"], "difficulty": 3, "plain": "控制元素怎麼擺：static(預設)、relative(相對自己微移)、absolute(相對定位祖先)、fixed(貼視窗)、sticky(捲到才黏)。", "related": ["z-index", "box-model", "css"] },
  { "slug": "z-index", "term": "z-index", "zh_name": "堆疊順序", "category": "syntax", "langs": ["css"], "difficulty": 2, "plain": "控制「誰疊在誰上面」，數字大的在上。⚠️ 只對有 position 的元素有效，且會受「堆疊上下文」影響常常失靈。", "related": ["css-position", "specificity"] },
  { "slug": "css-transition", "term": "transition", "zh_name": "過場動畫", "category": "syntax", "langs": ["css"], "difficulty": 2, "plain": "讓屬性變化「平滑地過渡」而不是瞬間跳(如 hover 變色漸變)。加一行 transition 就有質感。", "example": "transition: all 0.2s ease", "related": ["css-transform", "css-animation"] },
  { "slug": "css-transform", "term": "transform", "zh_name": "變形", "category": "syntax", "langs": ["css"], "difficulty": 2, "plain": "位移、旋轉、縮放、傾斜元素(translate/rotate/scale)。效能好(不觸發重排)，做動畫愛用。", "example": "transform: scale(1.1) rotate(5deg)", "related": ["css-transition", "css-animation"] },
  { "slug": "css-animation", "term": "@keyframes / animation", "zh_name": "CSS 動畫", "category": "syntax", "langs": ["css"], "difficulty": 3, "plain": "用 @keyframes 定義「動畫每個階段長怎樣」，再用 animation 套上去、可無限循環。做載入動畫、閃爍很好用。", "related": ["css-transition", "css-transform"] },
  { "slug": "css-units", "term": "px / rem / em / vw", "zh_name": "CSS 單位", "category": "concept", "langs": ["css"], "difficulty": 2, "plain": "px 固定像素；rem 相對根字級(做 RWD 好用)；em 相對父字級；vw/vh 相對視窗大小。用相對單位才好響應式。", "related": ["responsive-design", "media-query"] },
